"\n"
"Maintainers\n"
"-----------\n"
"\n"
"This module is part of the `KMEE/kmee-odoo-addons <https://github.com/KMEE/kmee-odoo-addons/tree/20.0/stock_picking_reports_declaration>`_ project on GitHub.\n"
